OL,15,G0350FWitness History
OL,16,     GIn 1991, African journalists
OL,17,     Gcreated the Windhoek declaration
OL,18,     G-a set of free press principles.
OL,19,     GIt led to World Press Freedom Day
OL,20,     Gmarked annually on 3 May.
